{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43625","headline":"渚山春暮会顾丞茗舍联句效小庾体 · 清昼","name":"渚山春暮会顾丞茗舍联句效小庾体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁是惜暮人，相携送春日。\n因君过茗舍，留客开兰室。\n湿苔滑行屐，柔草低藉瑟。\n鹊喜语成双，花狂落非一。\n烟浓山焙动，泉破水舂疾。\n莫抝挂瓢枝，会移阆书帙。\n颇容樵与隐，岂闻禅兼律。\n栏竹不求疎，网藤从更密。\n池添逸少墨，园杂庄生漆。\n景晏枕犹欹，酒醒头懒栉。\n云教淡机虑，地可遗名实。\n应待御荈青，幽期踏芳出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}